sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Ad as Administrator
    participant UI as React SPA
    participant API as FastAPI router
    participant C as crud.create_device
    participant S as services
    participant DB as SQLite
    Ad->>UI: fill name, type, IP, status
    UI->>UI: validateDevice(form)
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/devices
    API->>API: Pydantic DeviceCreate (IPv4 check)
    API->>C: create_device(payload)
    C->>DB: SELECT device WHERE ip_address = ?
    alt IP already used
        C-->>API: DomainError 409
        API-->>UI: 409 "already assigned to DEV-xxx"
    else IP free
        C->>DB: SELECT ids (devices + status_logs)
        C->>S: next_device_id(ids)
        S-->>C: "DEV-007"
        C->>DB: INSERT devices, INSERT status_logs (REGISTERED)
        API-->>UI: 201 Created DeviceOut
        UI-->>Ad: toast "registered as DEV-007"
    end
